     and the containing 0.05° CHIRPS cell mean elevation (queried at cell centre).
   - Column in Section C.1 renamed to: 'Station elev − cell mean'
   - Column in Section C.5 renamed to: 'Station − cell mean'

2. Peak-minus-cell-mean computation:
   - Status: UNAVAILABLE [logs/item_mfno.log:40–43]
   - Reason: No 30 m SRTM DEM raster grid is stored in the workspace or cache (documented as 'Not yet fetched'
     in docs/PROVENANCE.md). Individual cell-mean values were obtained via point queries (gate.py / open-elevation API)
